      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leadwood%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from the abundant lead mining and surrounding woodlands that once defined the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
