      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/leadwood-54104"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office operated in Leadwood from 1905 until 1966, marking the town’s early communication hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leadwood%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Historic Sanborn maps of Leadwood are preserved in the University of Missouri’s collection, offering a window into its past layout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
